# Visual constitution

Follow `ART_GUIDE.md` exactly. Do not improvise visuals.

- Internal resolution 320×180, integer scale only, point filter, no AA
- Characters 16×24, tiles 16×16, props 16–32px
- Use only the locked 32-color palette in `src/palette.js`
- Visual hierarchy: background < character < interactable < danger
- Interactable feedback: object moves 1px up + 2-frame bounce. No outline.
- Particles are integer pixels. No blur, no glow, no soft gradients
- Accidents are shown by sprites/stems, never by warning text
- If a visual decision is not in ART_GUIDE.md, reuse an existing rule instead of inventing one
